language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

scenario RecoverTarget.
condition RecoverTargetReady.
condition RecoverTargetContinue.
condition RecoverTargetReject.
outcome RecoverTargetCompleted.
outcome RecoverTargetRejected.
step RecoverTargetAdvertise.
step RecoverTargetChoose.
step RecoverTargetDeliver.
step RecoverTargetRebuild.
step RecoverTargetFailure.
step RecoverTargetSuccess.

RecoverTarget illustrates InspectConnectionHealth.
RecoverTarget exercises BoundedPhysicalTransport.
RecoverTarget starts-when RecoverTargetReady.
RecoverTarget starts-at RecoverTargetAdvertise.
RecoverTargetReady describes "Machine reconnects to a configured target with possible buffered history.".
RecoverTargetContinue describes "The previous operation succeeded and the next step's declared contract preconditions remain true; exact predicates are an executable-language gap.".
RecoverTargetReject describes "Validation, authority, applicability or operation failure prevents continuation; preserve prior valid state and report the specific reason.".
RecoverTargetCompleted describes "The stated design path completed under its explicit obligations; this is not an observed test result.".
RecoverTargetRejected describes "The path terminated without claiming the requested change succeeded; failures remain observable.".
RecoverTarget preserves NoPhysicalExecution.
RecoverTarget preserves DistinctSequenceDomains.
RecoverTargetAdvertise calls BufferTargetHistory within P1000Gateway.
RecoverTargetAdvertise describes "Expose range/count/age/overflow without blind replay.".
RecoverTargetAdvertise proceeds-to RecoverTargetFailure when RecoverTargetReject.
RecoverTargetAdvertise proceeds-to RecoverTargetChoose when RecoverTargetContinue.
RecoverTargetChoose calls ConsumeTargetRecord within MachineService.
RecoverTargetChoose describes "Explicit resume/live-only/discard chosen from typed target state.".
RecoverTargetChoose proceeds-to RecoverTargetFailure when RecoverTargetReject.
RecoverTargetChoose proceeds-to RecoverTargetDeliver when RecoverTargetContinue.
RecoverTargetDeliver calls RecoverTargetHistory within P1000Gateway.
RecoverTargetDeliver describes "Delivery commit acknowledges internal delivery, not P1000 semantics.".
RecoverTargetDeliver proceeds-to RecoverTargetFailure when RecoverTargetReject.
RecoverTargetDeliver proceeds-to RecoverTargetRebuild when RecoverTargetContinue.
RecoverTargetRebuild calls AdvanceP1000Protocol within MachineService.
RecoverTargetRebuild describes "Evidence-backed protocol recovery; no stale physical TX.".
RecoverTargetRebuild proceeds-to RecoverTargetFailure when RecoverTargetReject.
RecoverTargetRebuild proceeds-to RecoverTargetSuccess when RecoverTargetContinue.
RecoverTargetFailure finishes RecoverTarget with RecoverTargetRejected.
RecoverTargetSuccess finishes RecoverTarget with RecoverTargetCompleted.
RecoverTargetAdvertise emits TargetResponses through TargetChannel.
RecoverTargetChoose receives TargetResponses through TargetChannel.
RecoverTargetChoose emits TargetRequests through TargetChannel.
RecoverTargetDeliver receives TargetRequests through TargetChannel.
